Derived from FrankerFaceZ commit fe229ea (2026-10-20):
- styles/*.scss: copied from src/sites/twitch-twilight/modules/css_tweaks/styles/
  (portrait, portrait-chat, chat-fix, chat-no-animate, player-size, hide-side-nav).
  Changes: renamed the `ffz--` class prefix and `--ffz-` custom property prefix
  to `tpm--` / `--tpm-`, and removed the rule for FFZ's own chat card element.
- src/routes.js: route table and matching rules from src/sites/twitch-twilight/index.js
  and src/utilities/compat/fine-router.ts, reimplemented without dependencies.
- src/logic.js: Portrait Mode decision logic from src/sites/twitch-twilight/modules/layout.js
  and css_tweaks/index.js, reduced to FFZ's default values for its other features.
- src/react.js: React tree search helpers modeled on src/utilities/compat/fine.ts.

